      "value": "As our friends here have been pointing out, an Age Verification System, by itself, is not enough. The current system only allows individuals with a paid VRChat Plus subscription to create groups, or open group instances. While there are many groups, there are very few large public groups for adults, and even fewer who will open more than one instance. As such, the current environment still leaves most adults, age verified or not, with a lack of public age-gated instance to choose from. This makes \"age verification\" similar to purchasing a gift certificate with no place to spend it. While an Age Verification System may be a necessary first step in the right direction, it is only the first step. The ADULT CHILL SPOT is an adult group that has been working to resolve this issue with their Hosting Program. The ADULT CHILL SPOT offers non-plus users the opportunity to open group instances. They urge all 18+ age verified VRChat users to join their legion of 5000+ Members, and to assist in expanding their Hosting Program. Opening \"Your World, Your Way\", as a Host, is expected to bring a variety of gated public instances to the adult virtual landscape. As the ADULT CHILL SPOT Hosting Program expands, it plans to have a multitude of instances opened across the internet at the same time. Combining the Hosting Program to the Age Verification System should bring VRChat a lot closer to what our friends here have been hoping for..  World Optionaity and Age-Verified Security that more closely resembles the idea of VRChat For Adults. Please check out the ADULT CHILL SPOT Group and their Discord for more information!",
